// Zed keymap
//
// No settings.json key controls which Agent Panel tab (native chat vs.
// Terminal Thread) opens by default, so this adds a dedicated shortcut that
// jumps straight to a Terminal Thread (agent.terminal_init_command starts
// the DEFAULT_AGENT CLI there — see config/zed/settings.json). It's an
// addition, not an override: whatever key/click already opens the Agent
// Panel still opens Zed's native chat as before.
[
  {
    "bindings": {
      "ctrl-alt-t": "agent::NewTerminalThread"
    }
  }
]
